#. and the
#.       <application>
#. GIMP-2.0</application>.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gutenprint.xml:30
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Gutenprint</application> (formerly <application>Gimp-"
"Print</application>) package contains high quality drivers for many brands "
"and models of printers for use with <xref linkend=\"cups\"/>.  See a list of"
" supported printers at <ulink "
"url=\"https://gutenprint.sourceforge.net/p_Supported_Printers.php\"/>."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>Gutenprint</application> (anteriormente "
"<application>Gimp-Print</application>) contém controladores de alta "
"qualidade para muitas marcas e modelos de impressoras para uso com o <xref "
"linkend=\"cups\"/>. Veja-se uma lista de impressoras suportadas em <ulink "
"url=\"https://gutenprint.sourceforge.net/p_Supported_Printers.php\"/>."

